# Secret Invasion: "Enchanted creature has ward {2}" and "up to one target": Bot1 casts it on its Ornithopter ({1}{U}{U} from
# Black Lotus) with no other creature to target, so its trigger is not put on the stack and nothing is exiled and the Ornithopter stays an Ornithopter. In Bot2's turn 4,
# Bot2's Lightning Bolt at the Ornithopter is answered by ward {2}: Bot2 pays exactly {2} with Forest and Mox Jet (the pool is
# empty after, so the ward is neither {1} nor {3}) and the Bolt resolves, killing the 0/2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Ornithopter
Black Lotus
Secret Invasion
Island x3
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x3
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Secret Invasion.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile.Count = 0
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot2.PayCost
? Bot2.Mana =

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter = (absent)
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Island
Bot1.Graveyard = Secret Invasion; Ornithopter; Black Lotus
